    "plan_update_summary": "### Cycle #22 Update: Overcoming Statutory Fee Drag & Mid-Session Whipsaws\nIn Cycle #22, the DeepSeek V4.1 Flash filter successfully lifted out-of-sample Win Rate to 53.8% and achieved positive gross P&L (+\u20b944.20), but \u20b946.90 in statutory fees dragged Net P&L to \u20b9-2.70 (PF 0.98). Forensic analysis of the losing cluster revealed systematic stop-outs at exactly the `0.70%` SL boundary during the 10:25\u201312:30 IST liquidity lull (e.g., TATASTEEL, NTPC, INFY) and fee-induced net losses on premature breakeven trails (ICICIBANK). For Cycle #23, we are widening `min_sl_pct` to its upper safe bound of `0.75%` to survive standard 5-minute intraday noise, increasing `min_sweep_vol_multiplier` to `2.85x` to demand stronger institutional participation during mid-day entries, pushing `breakeven_trigger_r` to `1.05R` so trailed stops clear transaction costs, and raising `min_target_pct` to `1.45%` to expand gross payoff per winning trade."
